                <h2 class="cfo-signal-card__title">2. Cash Flow Is Becoming More Difficult to Manage</h2>
                <p class="cfo-signal-card__text">
                  Revenue may be growing, but cash isn’t always where it needs to be. Forecasting, working capital
                  management, and planning become increasingly important.
                </p>
              </div>
